{% comment %}
  Announcement bar — rotating merchant messages with a dismiss control.

  Behaviour notes (task-header.md T-1.1):
  - Dismissal persists in localStorage. To avoid an empty bar flashing before the
    script has read storage, the bar renders with data-announcement and is hidden by
    CSS only once the script marks it as "should stay visible". See _state below.
  - No autoplay. Carousels that move on their own are an accessibility cost with no
    benefit here, and SDD §7.2 forbids fabricated urgency. Multiple messages scroll
    horizontally instead, with manual controls.
  - The close button is rendered by Liquid (not built by JS), so it exists even before
    the script runs. If the script never loads, it simply does nothing — hence the
    script removes it when it detects no JS capability rather than leaving a dead
    control behind.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign has_blocks = false
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == 'announcement'
      assign has_blocks = true
      break
    endif
  endfor
-%}

{%- if has_blocks -%}
  <aside
    class="announcement-bar"
    role="region"
    aria-label="{{ 'sections.announcement_bar.label' | t }}"
    data-announcement
  >
    <div class="announcement-bar__track" data-announcement-track>
      <ul
        class="announcement-bar__list"
        role="list"
        {% if section.blocks.size > 1 %}data-announcement-list{% endif %}
      >
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          <li
            class="announcement-bar__item"
            role="listitem"
            {% if forloop.index > 1 %}aria-hidden="true"{% endif %}
          >
            {%- if block.settings.link != blank -%}
              <a
                class="announcement-bar__link"
                href="{{ block.settings.link }}"
                {% unless forloop.first %}tabindex="-1"{% endunless %}
              >
                {{ block.settings.text }}
              </a>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="announcement-bar__text">{{ block.settings.text }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} 手动切换：仅多条时出现，不自动播放（见文件头注释） {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if section.blocks.size > 1 -%}
      <div class="announcement-bar__controls">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="announcement-bar__arrow announcement-bar__arrow--prev"
          aria-label="{{ 'sections.announcement_bar.previous' | t }}"
          data-announcement-prev
        >
          {{ 'icon-chevron-down.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
        </button>
        <p
          class="announcement-bar__count visually-hidden"
          aria-live="polite"
          data-announcement-status
        >
          {{ 'sections.announcement_bar.status' | t: index: 1, total: section.blocks.size }}
        </p>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="announcement-bar__arrow announcement-bar__arrow--next"
          aria-label="{{ 'sections.announcement_bar.next' | t }}"
          data-announcement-next
        >
          {{ 'icon-chevron-down.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
        </button>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.dismissible -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        由 Liquid 静态渲染，不依赖 JS 构建；无 JS 时脚本会移除它，
        避免留下点了没反应的控件（AGENTS §6：商家未填设置时不留空壳）。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <button
        type="button"
        class="announcement-bar__close"
        aria-label="{{ 'sections.announcement_bar.dismiss' | t }}"
        data-announcement-dismiss
      >
        {{ 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
      </button>
    {%- endif -%}
  </aside>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .announcement-bar {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-inline: var(--page-margin);
    /* 设计令牌：品牌色底 + 背景色字，对比度见 T-2.2 验收 */
    background-color: var(--color-brand);
    color: var(--color-background);
  }

  .announcement-bar__track {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .announcement-bar__list {
    display: flex;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .announcement-bar__item {
    flex: 0 0 100%;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  /* 非当前项对读屏隐藏（多条时才有 aria-hidden，见 Liquid） */
  .announcement-bar__item[aria-hidden='true'] {
    /* 视觉上移出可视区，但保留在 DOM 里以便切换 */
    position: absolute;
    visibility: hidden;
  }

  .announcement-bar__link,
  .announcement-bar__text {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding-block: 0.5rem;
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  /* 箭头准则（AGENTS §6）：卡内文字链接不加箭头，这里只给链接态加下划线 */
  .announcement-bar__link:hover,
  .announcement-bar__link:focus-visible {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .announcement-bar__controls {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .announcement-bar__arrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    /* 触摸目标 ≥ 44×44（AGENTS §8） */
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    color: inherit;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .announcement-bar__arrow svg {
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 0.75rem;
  }

  .announcement-bar__arrow--prev svg {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .announcement-bar__close {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    /* 视觉图标可小于点击区 */
    margin-inline-end: -0.5rem;
    color: inherit;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .announcement-bar__close svg {
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
  }

  /* 焦点态可见（SDD §8.2） */
  .announcement-bar :is(a, button):focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* 已关闭：JS 写入该属性后整条移除 */
  .announcement-bar[data-announcement--closed='true'] {
    display: none;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .announcement-bar__controls {
      display: none;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

<script src="{{ 'announcement-bar.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.announcement_bar",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "dismissible",
      "label": "t:labels.announcement_dismissible",
      "default": true
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "announcement",
      "name": "t:labels.announcement",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "t:labels.text",
          "default": "Free freight on orders over $99"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "link",
          "label": "t:labels.link"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 5,
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:general.announcement_bar",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "announcement"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "enabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
